OL,3,AWorld's oldest shipwreck found off
OL,4,Acoast of Turkey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe world's oldest shipwreck has been
OL,7,Fdiscovered off the coast of Turkey,
OL,8,Farchaeologists say.
OL,10,FThey have dated it to between 4,400 and
OL,11,F4,700 years old, which is the Early
OL,12,FBronze Age, and is around the same time
OL,13,Fthat the Great Pyramid was being built.
OL,15,FThe ship's wooden structure has not
OL,16,Fsurvived, but the ceramic storage pots
OL,17,Fit was carrying were lying on the sea
OL,18,Ffloor and, remarkably, some still
OL,19,Fcontain traces of what they held
OL,20,Finside.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
