OL,3,AWorld's oldest shipwreck found off
OL,4,Acoast of Turkey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe archaeologists who found the ship
OL,7,Fsay it was about 10m in length and was
OL,8,Fa trade vessel carrying cargo across
OL,9,Fthe Mediterranean Sea.
